  <div class="w-embed"></div><div class="hero3" style="opacity:0"><div class="hero-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="hero-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-59c7e07d15bf91.jpg"/></div><div class="hero-image-overlay"></div><div class="hero-content-wrapper"><div class="hero-content" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0"><div class="subtitle light">Suite du Bon-Vivant</div><h1 class="light">"Look at that view! Look at that view!" she repeated...</h1></div></div></div><div class="room-subhero-section"><div class="container"><div class="banner"><div class="collection-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div class="banner-collection-list w-dyn-items w-row" role="list"><div class="banner-collection-item w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><img alt="" class="room-amenity-icon" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-775a29094f4579.svg"/><p class="faq-question-title">Private Pool</p></div></div><div class="banner-collection-item w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><img alt="" class="room-amenity-icon" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-3874f118411b98.png"/><p class="faq-question-title">Extra Bed (+€80/n)</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section bottom-padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-halves"><div class="main-content"><p class="feature-paragraph smaller">Luxury holiday Suite with Pool - 2 people max - 55- 60 m2</p><h3>Suite du Bon-Vivant</h3><p>Our bright Suites du Bon-Vivant come with ample bedroom and lounging space, along with a luxury bathroom. The main attraction, however, is the exceptional terrace with a private pool. Here, the sunset is just magical.</p><p class="italics">Choose this one if you want a private pool and a gorgeous terrace to soak up the sun. The bon-vivant art collector's dream suite.</p><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button w-button" href="https://app.mews.com/distributor/150bd326-7c63-4a24-b668-abcf00c6bb22" target="_blank">Check Now</a></div></div><div class="secondary-content"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="w-dyn-items w-row" role="list"><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Bath tub</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Free WiFi</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Hair dryer</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Walk-in Shower</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Smart TV</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Kettle</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Free toiletries</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Bathrobes</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Outdoor furniture</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Safety box</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Ironing facilities</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Soundproofing</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Refrigerator</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section no-top-padding"><div class="full-frame-slider-wrapper"><div class="full-frame-slider w-slider" data-animation="cross" data-autoplay="true" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-delay="4000" data-disable-swipe="false" data-duration="500" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="false" data-infinite="true" data-nav-spacing="3"><div class="slider-mask w-slider-mask"><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-1c7ae91a066a89.jpg"/></div></div><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-6e462dbd80d420.jpg"/></div></div><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-ac17df3ab02619.jpg"/></div></div><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-6b1b2026576810.jpg"/></div></div></div><div class="left-arrow w-slider-arrow-left"><img alt="arrow left" class="slider-arrow-image" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-62e87937b486a8.svg"/></div><div class="right-arrow w-slider-arrow-right"><img alt="arrow right" class="slider-arrow-image" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-7d7a86fb467f08.svg"/></div><div class="slide-nav w-slider-nav w-slider-nav-invert w-round"></div></div></div></div><div class="section bottom-padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="grid-layout"><div class="grid-layout-section-content"><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper left-padding right-padding"><p class="feature-paragraph">This space offers a seamless fusion of contemporary and traditional design. The ideal hideaway for couples and friends to enjoy a refined holiday, breathtaking views and lots of quality time together.</p></div><div class="divider _144px mobile-none"></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper right-padding"><div class="card-image-wapper medium-height"><img alt="" class="card-image" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-6318088b5c037e.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><p>Carefully planned chill zone, for you to relax and put your mind at ease.</p></div></div></div><div class="grid-layout-section-content"><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper" data-w-id="9a2292a3-c1f2-9dae-ff8c-1931746eb56b"><div class="card-image-wapper-fixed small-height"><img alt="" class="card-image-fixed" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-d6597cd53b57f3.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><p>It is all about the light. Inside and outside. </p></div></div><div class="divider _96px mobile-none"></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper right-padding" data-w-id="9a2292a3-c1f2-9dae-ff8c-1931746eb577"><div class="card-image-wapper-fixed large-height"><img alt="" class="card-image-fixed" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-9609d592e8bbdc.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><p>Original Leroy Brothers artworks are installed throughout the suites.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section padding-96" style="background-color:#adb4a0"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper width-small centered"><p class="feature-paragraph" style="color:#fafaf8">Our inviting Suites are all different, which makes them unique.</p><p style="color:#fafaf8">Example of Suite layout.<br/>(plans are indicative and non binding)</p></div><img alt="" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-5a3292ecfd3f3b.png"/></div></div><div class="section padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper inner-spacing div-block"><h2>Explore other Suites</h2></div></div><div class="rooms-collection-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div class="room-flex-thirds w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="masartiste.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Mas de l'Artiste" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-6106adc613aeb2.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Mas de l'Artiste</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img hide" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a aria-current="page" class="room-link-block w-inline-block w--current" href="."><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite du Bon-Vivant" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-707417a43d47ee.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite du Bon-Vivant</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img hide" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suiteaartiste.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite de l'Artiste" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-e1708f1e9761a9.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite de l'Artiste</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img hide" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="penard.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite Pénard" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-eb795e7700a147.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite Pénard</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img hide" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="bronzette.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite de la Bronzette" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-8626fb58027da5.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite de la Bronzette</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img hide" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="penequet.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Villa du Pénéquet" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-5f8a45f5b552ed.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Villa du Pénéquet</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img hide" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suite-petanque.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite Pétanque" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-833a78c568fe35.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite Pétanque</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img hide" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suite-cabanat.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite Cabanat" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-826f21859fa23e.jpg"/></div><div class